{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22028","main_id":22028,"main_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","main_description":"翔太似乎得到了神明的回应，期待着神龛的再次显灵…","chapter_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2202809,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202809,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":220280902,"next_line_ids":[220280903],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":1083530074,"text":"很久以前，有一个大伯向这个神龛供奉了锻刀用的铁矿石，希望自己的武艺能够快快进步。","raw_text":"很久以前，有一个大伯向这个神龛供奉了锻刀用的铁矿石，希望自己的武艺能够快快进步。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202809.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22028","main_id":22028,"main_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","main_description":"翔太似乎得到了神明的回应，期待着神龛的再次显灵…","chapter_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2202809,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202809,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":220280903,"next_line_ids":[220280904],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":4140341210,"text":"后来那个大伯去参加比武，他的对手全都被他轻松打败了，他也被人家称赞说武艺高超。","raw_text":"后来那个大伯去参加比武，他的对手全都被他轻松打败了，他也被人家称赞说武艺高超。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202809.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22028","main_id":22028,"main_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","main_description":"翔太似乎得到了神明的回应，期待着神龛的再次显灵…","chapter_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2202809,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202809,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":220280904,"next_line_ids":[220280905,220280906],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":3572440986,"text":"不过，大伯说，他的那些对手似乎都有些身体上的…不适…","raw_text":"不过，大伯说，他的那些对手似乎都有些身体上的…不适…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202809.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22028","main_id":22028,"main_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","main_description":"翔太似乎得到了神明的回应，期待着神龛的再次显灵…","chapter_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2202809,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202809,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":220280905,"next_line_ids":[220280907],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":3086859010,"text":"这神明怎么这么没谱呢…","raw_text":"这神明怎么这么没谱呢…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202809.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22028","main_id":22028,"main_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","main_description":"翔太似乎得到了神明的回应，期待着神龛的再次显灵…","chapter_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2202809,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202809,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":220280907,"next_line_ids":[220280908],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":2577258434,"text":"不过无论如何，大家都觉得这也是神明显灵了。所以向这个神龛许愿，我觉得应该也能得到回应。","raw_text":"不过无论如何，大家都觉得这也是神明显灵了。所以向这个神龛许愿，我觉得应该也能得到回应。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202809.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22028","main_id":22028,"main_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","main_description":"翔太似乎得到了神明的回应，期待着神龛的再次显灵…","chapter_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2202809,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202809,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":220280908,"next_line_ids":[220280909],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":1949662986,"text":"先不说这些了！这一次，我们供奉什么比较好呢？","raw_text":"先不说这些了！这一次，我们供奉什么比较好呢？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202809.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22028","main_id":22028,"main_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","main_description":"翔太似乎得到了神明的回应，期待着神龛的再次显灵…","chapter_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2202809,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202809,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":220280909,"next_line_ids":[220280910],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":2571513658,"text":"和那个大伯一样，供奉铁矿石的话，或许也能得到回应！","raw_text":"和那个大伯一样，供奉铁矿石的话，或许也能得到回应！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202809.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22028","main_id":22028,"main_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","main_description":"翔太似乎得到了神明的回应，期待着神龛的再次显灵…","chapter_title":"神龛啊，再次显灵吧！","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":7,"subquest_id":2202809,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202809,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":220280910,"next_line_ids":[220280911],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3045,"speaker_text_hash":392349677,"speaker":"翔太","speaker_raw":"翔太","text_hash":1206444018,"text":"我在铁匠铺门口捡到过几块矿石，不过，它们的品质都不太好，铁匠师傅觉得送给我都无所谓。","raw_text":"我在铁匠铺门口捡到过几块矿石，不过，它们的品质都不太好，铁匠师傅觉得送给我都无所谓。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202809.json"}
